      "rationale": "Reviewed supplied card, latest declared usage and exact primary section 4.2 lines 165-189. Local near-null gain versus the residual parent and saturated gate diagnostics motivate testing normalization. Source equation 9 provides established RMS-normalized contextual transport as nearest prior art, not evidence that the source transfers or that knowledge caused a gain.",
